+"""ProofScope SOTA-1 competitor benchmark infrastructure (protocol: docs/competitor_benchmark_protocol.md).
+
+Nothing in this package decides mathematical truth. Gold labels come only from the sealed adjudication
+(`seal.py`); tool outputs are preserved verbatim and mapped to the shared outcome vocabulary by
+pre-registered, per-tool rules (`outcomes.py`).
+"""
